cuted successfully (exit 0) and attempted `os.open` with `O_WRONLY|O_CREAT|O_EXCL` at `/home/tcuni-claw/pi/pi-planner-only/.permission-probe-root-c3b070d70d9044529c5523d624fb38e1`. The actual result was `OSError: [Errno 30] Read-only file system`; `write_succeeded=false`. No file was created. Both parent and child therefore demonstrated runtime write denial under the repository."}}
